# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Agentic ADLC with GitHub Copilot — shared with participants.
#
# Tracked: the outline (HTML + PDF), the eight decks and their shared assets/,
# the metrics board and the deck-check scripts.
#
# Nothing sensitive or client-related belongs in this folder, tracked or not.
# Credentials, internal delivery notes and client correspondence live outside
# it, with the trainer.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets, should one ever be dropped here by mistake
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key

# Trainer-only material. It lives in trainer-private/ outside this folder;
# these lines stop a copy dropped back in here from ever being committed.
CLAUDE.md
TRAINER-README.md
*-trainer.md
runsheet.md
delivery-map.md
todo/
key.md
*-snapshot.json

# Local working resources: learning-outcomes tracker and video list
resources/

# The pre-course machine check: sent to participants separately, kept local
machine-setup.md

# Local tool and editor state
.claude/
.github/modernize/
*.code-workspace
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
node_modules/

# Verification artifacts from the print checks
*.pdf.tmp
check.pdf
/m[0-9].pdf
/tmp/

# Python bytecode from labs/scripts/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
